---

# Icons

Icons remain optional.

Use only when they improve understanding.

Recommended:

History

Cloud

Connection

Warning

Training

Profile

Avoid decorative illustrations.

---

# Motion

Allowed:

Subtle appearance.

Fade-in.

Native transitions.

Not allowed:

Animated mascots.

Repeated animations.

Decorative motion.

Respect Reduced Motion.

---

# Color Usage

Background:

Graphite Black

Primary action:

Performance Orange

Neutral:

Steel Gray

Success:

Recovery Green

Warning:

Warning Amber

Critical:

Critical Red

Use color only to reinforce meaning.

Never as the sole information channel.

---

# Accessibility

Support:

Dynamic Type

VoiceOver

High Contrast

Reduced Motion

Every empty state must remain understandable without images.

---

# Content Rules

Titles:

Maximum 6 words.

Descriptions:

Maximum 2 sentences.

Primary Action:

One clear verb.

Avoid technical language.

Avoid implementation details.

---

# Do

Explain clearly.

Offer the next logical action.

Remain reassuring.

Support offline usage.

Keep messages concise.

---

# Do Not

Display blank screens.

Use error codes as primary content.

Expose technical exceptions.

Blame the athlete.

Use marketing language.

Create dead ends.

---

# Success Criteria

Every empty state should:

Explain the situation.

Reduce uncertainty.

Guide the athlete.

Provide an obvious next action.

---

# Final Principle

Every empty state is part of the coaching experience.

When CAS has nothing to show,

it should still know how to help.